@EnterpriseIntegrationHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5194

### Browse external systems
GET {{EnterpriseIntegrationHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/external-systems
Accept: application/json

### Create external system
POST {{EnterpriseIntegrationHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/external-systems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Orders API",
  "description": "Order management service",
  "environment": "Development"
}

### Browse connectors
GET {{EnterpriseIntegrationHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/connectors
Accept: application/json

### Browse workflows
GET {{EnterpriseIntegrationHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workflows
Accept: application/json

### Swagger JSON (Development)
GET {{EnterpriseIntegrationHub.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
